globs: "src/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Core

- App Router only (`src/app`). Route files stay thin.
- Folder-per-component: `<name>/index.tsx` (never flat `_components/foo.tsx`).
- Route-only UI → `src/app/<route>/_components/<name>/`.
- Layout / homepage → `src/app/_components/<name>/`.
- Shared (≥2 routes) → `src/components/` (`ui/` flat for shadcn CLI).
- Infra in `src/lib/` (env, http, utils); API helpers in `src/utils/`.
- Prefer Server Components; mark `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Validate public env with Zod in `src/lib/env.ts`.
- Named exports for components; default exports only for Next route files.
